/* =========================================================
   STOCKFLOW - GOOGLE APPS SCRIPT BACKEND
   =========================================================

   Main responsibilities:

   - Employee registration
   - Admin registration
   - Login
   - OTP generation
   - OTP storage in Google Sheets
   - OTP synchronization with Firebase
   - Email OTP
   - Phone OTP through Twilio
   - OTP verification
   - Account status management
   - Password recovery
   - Recovery OTP verification
   - Server-side recovery token
   - Password reset
   - User lookup
   - API status endpoint

   IMPORTANT:

   OTP IS GENERATED ONLY HERE ON THE SERVER.

   Frontend JavaScript must NEVER generate the OTP.

   DEMO_MODE = false:
   OTP is generated and stored only on the server.
   The OTP is never returned to the frontend.

   The verification page requires the user to manually enter
   the code received through the configured delivery channel.
   ========================================================= */


/* =========================================================
   CONFIGURATION
   ========================================================= */

